  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></math></p><p>Dimensions of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;should be equal to dimensions of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi></math>. Similarly, dimensions of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;will be equal to dimensions of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>Therefore, dimensions of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
